{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno Strike is a sci-fi card battler inspired by RTS games. Command your forces across the galaxy in fast-paced, strategic battles. Outsmart opponents and adapt your tactics to dominate every duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense, competitive gameplay where every decision counts. Build your decks, discover powerful synergies, and face both AI and real players in thrilling multiplayer battles. Game challenges you to think ahead, master timing, and prove your strategic skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno Strike features over 250 unique cards, divided into 4 factions and 7 distinct card types, offering a rich variety of strategies. Beyond land and space units, players can include action cards, equipment, traps, garrisons, and turrets in their decks to gain tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is currently in beta, developed by a small dedicated team.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987410?t=1768997350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987410/a38823f0d33eff5deb74d8c7a6eee7f181210433/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768997350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987410/90ca9ac251924e029d3de15b4f8fc735b292c06d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768997350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987410/90ca9ac251924e029d3de15b4f8fc735b292c06d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768997350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno Strike is a sci-fi card battler inspired by RTS games. Command your forces across the galaxy in fast-paced, strategic battles. Outsmart oppon